  "body": "· Modern freehold home - double-glazed, low-maintenance living\r\n· Sunny and bright with high ceilings that create a spacious feel throughout\r\n· North-facing deck - fully fenced and perfect for pets\r\n· Prime Orewa location - walk to the beach, cafes, shops, and transport\r\n· Built in 2020 - move-in ready and beautifully presented\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been searching for a modern, low-maintenance home just moments from the beach, this single-level freehold property ticks every box - and with only a couple of these homes left, now is the time to act.\r\n\r\nCompleted in 2020, the home is beautifully presented and ready for immediate enjoyment. High ceilings create a bright, open feel, while the contemporary kitchen and spacious living area flow effortlessly to a large, north-facing deck - fully fenced and perfect for sunny outdoor living.\r\n\r\nBoth double bedrooms are generous and light-filled, each with built-in wardrobes. The fully tiled bathroom features a skylight, adding to the fresh, airy atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe garage includes the laundry, offers secure internal access, and opens to the rear garden for added convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location truly elevates the lifestyle. A short stroll brings you to Orewa Beach for swimming, surfing, or a relaxed paddle. Cafes, shops, restaurants, and transport links are all close by, making everyday life wonderfully easy.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-home buyers, downsizers, investors, or anyone wanting to embrace beachside living - it’s an opportunity worth acting on.\r\n\r\nFor more details, contact me today.",
